  "bruteReference": "Two independent brutes: (1) bottom-up carry: walk every level from min k to max k with need = max(a_L, ceil(need/4)), then ceil-divide by 4 until one box remains above max k; (2) top-down slot feasibility: increase p from 1, require all k<p and a_L <= 4^(p-L) slots at every level. Both asserted equal to the oracle on all 1..3-subsets of k in 0..4 with a in 1..17 (exhaustive), 3000 fixed-seed random cases (k<40, a up to 10^9), and 4^m-1/4^m/4^m+1 boundaries.",
